                  \\end{aligned}
          %p
            Equation
            %a.maruku-eqref{:href => "#eq:NormalizedCommutationforsu2"} (9)
            shows that in the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/large+N+limit"} large N limit
            = succeed "," do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
