                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} X_i
            becomes commutative, and
            %a.maruku-eqref{:href => "#eq:RadiusOfFuzzy2Sphere"} (10)
            says that for any
            = succeed "," do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
