          %h3#fuzzy_2sphere_2 Fuzzy 2-sphere
          %p
            On the
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/fuzzy+2-sphere"} fuzzy 2-sphere
          %h4#general_2 General
          %p
            The
