                %em A note on spectral triple with real structure on fuzzy sphere
                (
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/2111.03012"}> arXiv:2111.03012
                )
          %p
            In the context of the
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/IKKT+matrix+model"} IKKT matrix model
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Harold+Steinacker"}> Harold Steinacker
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %em Non-commutative geometry and matrix models
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1109.5521"} arXiv:1109.5521
          %p
            Concerning
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/2d+CFT"} 2d CFT
            on the fuzzy sphere:
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                Giulia Fardelli, A. Liam Fitzpatrick,
                = succeed ":" do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Emanuel+Katz"} Emanuel Katz
