                \&amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/2503.00100"}> arXiv:2503.00100
                \&amp;rbrack;
          %p See also:
          %ul
            %li
              Wikipedia,
              %em
                %a{:href => "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fuzzy_sphere"} Fuzzy sphere
          %h4#observables_via_weight_systems_on_chord_diagrams Observables via weight systems on chord diagrams
          %p
            Relation of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Dp-D%28p%2B2%29-brane+bound+states"} Dp-D(p+2)-brane bound states
            (
            %a{:href => "Dp-Dp+2-brane+bound+states#ReferencesRelationToMonopoles"} hence
